  "description": "**Original Novel:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/50238988), [Naver Series](https://m.series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=3889095)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/297032441), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/55846049), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.nhn?productNo=4797716), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/rainy_night)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Indonesian ](https://www.webtoons.com/id/romance/rainy-night/list?title_no=2252)  \n\n“If I love you, it will still be burdensome, right?“\n\n\nThe woman, Yeowon, who couldn't covet anything.  \nThis man who wants so much, Seo Yu-in.  \nTwo people who have permeated each other like gently raindrops.  \nOn a rainy night, the story of a lover begins.\n\n\n“I, I think you really like it.“  \nAs In-in faced him inside the umbrella, he blew the rain.  \n“Did you know you like me now? Because of the rain?  \n\"No, it was a long time ago that I liked it...\" ... .”  \nConsidering Yoo In's personality, it was an overly calm confession.  \n“I didn’t know I liked it this much.“",
